{"id":"5108757a70d00b41","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-analytic-prenex-formula.md","title":"Π¹₁ 与 Σ¹₁ 前束公式","display":"df-analytic-prenex-formula — Π¹₁ 与 Σ¹₁ 前束公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-analytic-prenex-formula","aliases":["18-df-analytic-prenex-formula","18-df-040"],"display":"df-analytic-prenex-formula — Π¹₁ 与 Σ¹₁ 前束公式","depends_on":["[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","[[18-df-free-variable]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§5.1 and Definition 5.4.1","source_pages":"71–73,77","source_pdf_pages":"81–83,87","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-analytic-prenex-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-analytic-prenex-formula</span><span>18-df-040</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analytic-prenex-formula — Π¹₁ 与 Σ¹₁ 前束公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.1 and Definition 5.4.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"71–73,77"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"81–83,87"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X=\\{X_i:i&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathcal X=\\{X_i:i&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span> 中仅有数变量量词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\">\\(\\forall X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\">\\(\\exists X\\)</span> 是与数变量量词区分的二阶前缀构造子，变量类型由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal X\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal X\\)</span> 确定；每次应用增加一个有限树节点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{All}_1,\\mathrm{Some}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{All}_1,\\mathrm{Some}_1\\)</span> 在有限集合变量列长度上递归，作用于算术矩阵和已加同类前缀的公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{inc}\">\\(\\mathrm{inc}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a> 的有限自然数集合递增枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_1(F),\\vec X_F,\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\">\\(I_1(F),\\vec X_F,\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\\)</span> 在下式定义；闭包恰绑定全部自由集合变量，顺序固定，不绑定数变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1,\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1,\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span> 为前束语法类，允许自由参数，不是轻面点集类。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\)</span> 是对全部自由集合变量作无重复全称闭包的公式集合，保留全部变量排列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\\)</span> 只选择其中一个确定代表，不排除其余闭包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{All}_1(\\langle\\rangle,F)&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}_1(\\langle X\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec Y,F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall X\\,\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec Y,F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\langle\\rangle,F)&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\langle X\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec Y,F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists X\\,\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\vec Y,F),\\\\\n\\Pi^1_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X,F):n&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^n,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^1_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\vec X,F):n&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^n,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\nI_1(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i&lt;\\omega:X_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)\\},\\\\\n\\vec X_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle X_{\\mathrm{inc}(I_1(F))_j}:j&lt;|I_1(F)|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X_F,F)\n\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{All}_1(\\langle\\rangle,F)&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}_1(\\langle X\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec Y,F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall X\\,\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec Y,F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\langle\\rangle,F)&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\langle X\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec Y,F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists X\\,\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\vec Y,F),\\\\\n\\Pi^1_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X,F):n&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^n,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^1_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\vec X,F):n&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^n,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\nI_1(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i&lt;\\omega:X_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)\\},\\\\\n\\vec X_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle X_{\\mathrm{inc}(I_1(F))_j}:j&lt;|I_1(F)|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X_F,F)\n\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X,F):\n\\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^{|\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)|},\\ \\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X)=\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)\\}\n\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X,F):\n\\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^{|\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)|},\\ \\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X)=\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)\\}\n\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据 §5.1 的二阶层次，只计集量词的交替。当前两类是一个集量词块的前束代表；未把一般含自由集参数的公式冒称轻面集合定义。伪 Π¹₁ 句是无自由数变量的算术矩阵，见算术 Tait 语言节点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}$、$\\mathcal X=\\{X_i:i<\\omega\\}$ 和 $\\mathrm{FV}_1$ 取 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]；$\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 中仅有数变量量词。$\\forall X$、$\\exists X$ 是与数变量量词区分的二阶前缀构造子，变量类型由 $X\\in\\mathcal X$ 确定；每次应用增加一个有限树节点。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{All}_1,\\mathrm{Some}_1$ 在有限集合变量列长度上递归，作用于算术矩阵和已加同类前缀的公式。$\\mathrm{inc}$ 取 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的有限自然数集合递增枚举。$I_1(F),\\vec X_F,\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)$ 在下式定义；闭包恰绑定全部自由集合变量，顺序固定，不绑定数变量。$\\Pi^1_1,\\Sigma^1_1$ 为前束语法类，允许自由参数，不是轻面点集类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X=\\{X_i:i<\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists X","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{All}_1,\\mathrm{Some}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{inc}","display":false},{"tex":"I_1(F),\\vec X_F,\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1,\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{All}_1(\\langle\\rangle,F)&\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}_1(\\langle X\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec Y,F)&\\coloneqq\\forall X\\,\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec Y,F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\langle\\rangle,F)&\\coloneqq F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\langle X\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec Y,F)&\\coloneqq\\exists X\\,\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\vec Y,F),\\\\\n\\Pi^1_1&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X,F):n<\\omega,\\ \\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^n,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^1_1&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Some}_1(\\vec X,F):n<\\omega,\\ \\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^n,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\nI_1(F)&\\coloneqq\\{i<\\omega:X_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)\\},\\\\\n\\vec X_F&\\coloneqq\\langle X_{\\mathrm{inc}(I_1(F))_j}:j<|I_1(F)|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X_F,F)\n\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{All}_1(\\vec X,F):\n\\vec X\\in\\mathcal X^{|\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)|},\\ \\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X)=\\mathrm{FV}_1(F)\\}\n\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\quad(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}).","display":true}],"bytes":3168,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]"},{"id":"fdadd493aba9167e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 取 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]；$V^\\alpha$ 取 [[18-df-verification-calculus]]，$\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}$ 取 [[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]。$F^\\nabla$ 在有限公式树上递归，收集顶层析取分支。$\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F),\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)$ 取 [[18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]；前者包含全部自由集合变量的所有无重复全称闭包，后者是按固定枚举选取的代表。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-analytic-prenex-formula|18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-analytic-prenex-formula|18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["7ddb1b71680edcd2","0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f"]}